abstract: >
  A candidate phenomenological framework modeling coherence dynamics across
  inheritance boundaries. Provides a canonical ODE (dC/dt = −α·D̄ + β·F + γ·R·ū − δ·C),
  formal propositions for trajectory error accumulation and early-warning detection,
  and four lane instantiations (quantum information, software systems, ecological
  inheritance, enterprise governance). Includes an ExecutionProof engine mapping.
  Phase 1 open review — not peer-reviewed science.
